  (text "1. GLV POWER INPUT & 5 V REFERENCE SUPPLY" (at 22.86 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5e51d7df-8986-43dd-a990-19b83a316b11))
  (text "2. REFERENCES & TRIM THRESHOLDS (all ratiometric to +5V)" (at 228.6 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 767c79ce-a96b-4db1-a23c-75dce93df598))
  (text "3. SENSOR INPUTS (own sensors; each signal on its own connector, T 11.6.7)" (at 22.86 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e5a76469-4ff1-46b4-9a9f-86da6d7e1634))
  (text "4. PLAUSIBILITY (T 11.6.1) + 500 ms TIMER (T 11.6.2)" (at 228.6 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ebd4115b-b9d6-491c-a813-9c677d52eaca))
  (text "5. SCS OPEN/SHORT DETECTION (T 11.9.2)" (at 436.88 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7ef33716-4a6d-4593-8dbd-5c23cafb02be))
  (text "6. LATCH + SDC RELAY OUTPUT" (at 22.86 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 10888d10-32a9-4d52-b06a-8b40138daf5f))
  (text "7. TEST PADS (no connector)" (at 436.88 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid da0574bf-e05d-4a22-a294-052247550cc4))
  (text "DESIGN NOTES - checked against FS Rules 2025 v1.0 (T 11.6, T 11.9, T 1.3.1, CV 1.4.3, CV 4.1)\nComparators: U1A hard brake | U1B throttle > 20 % | U1D 500 ms timer | U1C latch\n             U2A/U2B brake signal window | U2D/U2C throttle signal window\nT 11.6.1  Trip when BRK > BRK_TH AND TPS > TPS_TH. Latched until LVMS power cycle.\nT 11.6.2  Delay 0.693 x R19 x C17 = 326 ms (Monte-Carlo 256-350 ms) < 500 ms.\nT 11.6.3  J1 wired DIRECTLY from LVMS output (only fuse/connectors in between).\nT 11.6.4  Only interfaces: J1 power, J2/J6 brake sensor, J3/J7 throttle sensor, J4 SDC.\nT 11.6.5  RV1 range 0.66-1.27 V = 5.6-26.4 bar (MLH02K 0.5-4.5 V = 0-138 bar): always <= 30 bar.\n          Set below wheel-lock pressure. BRK_TH = 0.5 V + 0.029 V/bar x P.\nT 11.6.7  Each sensor signal on its own connector (J6, J7) - unplug to test.\nT 11.9.2  Open / short-GND / short-5V on any sensor wire -> trip in ~70 ms.\nCV 1.4.3  Throttle sensor on the THROTTLE BODY shaft. TPS_TH = V_idle + 0.20 x (V_WOT - V_closed).\nCV 4.1.1  K1 COM(1)/NO(3) in series with the SDC; SDC must feed >=2 mechanical relays\n          (fuel pump relay + ignition/injection relay).  CV 4.1.3: de-energised K1 = SDC open.\nC5 must be tantalum (LDO stability). Lock RV1/RV2 with paint after setting." (at 436.88 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cfee036b-90ee-42fe-9532-99737146085e))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
